{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["לא תונה — with words. For in the case of money it is written ״לא תונו איש את אחיו״. And the same applies to all Israelites, but Scripture spoke of the situation at hand, where one could oppress the stranger with words about the deeds of his fathers and about his deeds in his gentile state." "ולא תלחצנו — to do your labor. Because he has no redeemer, as it is written: ״וגם ראיתי את הלחץ אשר מצרים לוחצים אותם״." "כי גרים הייתם — as is explicitly stated before us: ״ואתם ידעתם את נפש הגר״. כי גרים הייתם — and because his suffering is great, his punishment is great."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:40.829975093Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}